{"summary":"Epic adventure of more than 20 hours through video games history","description":"Onboard on an epic RPG adventure of more than <b>20 hours</b> through video games history filled with a ton of funny classical games references.  \n\nFrom <font color=\"blue\">2D RPG</font>, through <font color=\"blue\">3D vs fight</font> to a <font color=\"blue\">shooter</font>, a <font color=\"blue\">trading card game</font> and more you’ll get your fill of jumping from a game genre to another, never bored. Evoland 2 is not only one game but many, backboned with a story that will make you travel through time, discovering different art styles and video gaming technology.\n\nReleased first on PC with 500.000 copies shipped, we’re proud to share with you this experience carefully adapted for Android devices. \n\nAdditional information: \n* One time payment to download (Absolutely <b>NO ads</b> and <b>NO in-app payments</b>). \n* Support of most bluetooth external controllers\n* Optimized for NVIDIA Shield and NVIDIA devices. \n\nIf you experience any issue with Evoland 2, please contact our customer support at <b>hello@playdigious.com</b> and give us as much as possible information on your problem.","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence, Use of Alcohol, Mild Language","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pYKoexQVX5U?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0nG7habXfBkLYA-8m8Czp96pYJMNK5x_nQKnOOU8bAAIKDc7kRpqDJpE1639MiEiMAf8NTRm5sFUFEJhZSSv","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IuTx457ZJO6BFv-T8LU3bmbCzuuViQRRketdAqO8kZBXXFnmQTE9zWCIRbQCWqnJ94Rbygl9GlzrMHLebW3BmQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/czQS9go7aRhp_PgHTLsXtiVpdJVQklBPGT9gTUvK1CP8dEV5AZRP9nI_RGKJRVfbr0DNZrbAemYXJqM1-k0GUA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Keh3Eutm3IBgxBQPVIBm-gRacwWUtUjs_d0nleAHjfkADLT5r0DjfLr5-gc76zja6AwagdKvjvbYF5vqcoasig","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UEND-XpsVuA_zfUz57_VJh